<section class="section mobile-accordion" id="itinerary">
  <div class="section-header fade-in">
    <span class="section-icon">📋</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">每日<span class="primary">行程</span>详情</h2>
    <div class="section-title-underline"></div>
    <p class="section-subtitle">点击卡片展开查看每天的三餐、住宿、活动和驾驶信息</p>
  </div>

  <div class="fade-in" id="itinerary-list">
    <div id="route-main-cards">
    <!-- Day 1 -->
    <div class="itinerary-card day-card">
      <div class="itinerary-header" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
        <div class="itinerary-header-left">
          <div class="day-badge"><div class="day-num">1</div><div class="day-label">DAY</div></div>
          <div class="day-info">
            <div class="day-title">🚗 洞口 → 贵阳</div>
            <div class="day-meta">
              <span>📅 8月8日 周六</span>
              <span>🛣️ 750km</span>
              <span>⏱️ 8-9h</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="toggle-icon">⌄</span>
      </div>
      <div class="itinerary-body">
        <div class="itinerary-body-inner">
          <div class="drive-section">
            <div class="drive-info">🛣️ 全程高速约750km，预计8-9小时。建议早起出发，途中芷江下高速午餐</div>
          </div>
          <div class="meal-section">
            <div class="section-label">🍴 餐饮安排</div>
            <div class="meal-grid">
              <div class="meal-card">
                <div class="meal-type">早餐</div>
                <div class="meal-name">自备干粮</div>
                <div class="meal-detail">路上解决，省时间赶路</div>
                
              </div>
              <div class="meal-card">
                <div class="meal-type">午餐</div>
                <div class="meal-name">芷江鸭</div>
                <div class="meal-detail">芷江下高速，芷江鸭是当地名菜</div>
                <div class="meal-price">人均50元</div>
              </div>
              <div class="meal-card">
                <div class="meal-type">晚餐</div>
                <div class="meal-name">青云市集</div>
                <div class="meal-detail">丝娃娃、肠旺面、恋爱豆腐果<span class="food-tag">必吃</span></div>
                <div class="meal-price">人均40-60元</div>
              </div>
